OL,3,GNEWSADriver jailed after pedestrian
OL,4,Adies from crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver who was under the influence of
OL,7,Fcannabis has been jailed after hitting
OL,8,Fa pedestrian who was trying to cross
OL,9,Fthe road in Margate.
OL,11,FJamie Sutton, 30, admitted causing
OL,12,Fdeath by careless driving and drug
OL,13,Fdriving following the collision in his
OL,14,FAudi in Northdown Road, Cliftonville,
OL,15,Fon 18 April 2024.
OL,17,FThe pedestrian, a man in his 70s, was
OL,18,Ftreated in hospital for serious
OL,19,Finjuries and discharged, but died from
OL,20,Fcomplications relating to his injuries
OL,21,Fin February 2025, Kent Police said.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
