OL,3,GNEWSADriver jailed after pedestrian
OL,4,Adies from crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FSutton, formerly of Northdown Road, was
OL,7,Farrested at the scene and jailed for
OL,8,Fthree and a half years at Canterbury
OL,9,FCrown Court on Wednesday.
